{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t山西臨汾市洪洞縣發生黃土崩塌，造成5人死亡。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n臨汾市政府表示，事發在昨晚近7時。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T02:20:14.963135+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":47,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none"}}